---
description: React conventions and the visual language of the schedule grid.
globs: apps/web/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `.claude/skills/ui-component/SKILL.md`.

- Components render; derived state and data fetching live in hooks. No clinical
  logic in a component.
- Forms use the Zod schema from `packages/contracts`. Never redeclare a shape.
- Use the custom properties in `src/styles/tokens.css`. Do not introduce a new hex
  value in a component.
- 36 rows at 28px must fit on a 1080p screen without scrolling. If it does not
  fit, remove chrome — do not shrink the row.
- Every interactive element is keyboard-operable with a visible focus ring.
  Skeletons, not spinners. Empty states say what to do next.
